  {"seed_key":"gp_ext_de_yoroshii_deshouka","grammar_point":"〜でよろしいでしょうか","canonical_form":"〜でよろしいでしょうか","sense_key":"service_de_yoroshii_deshouka","form_group_slug":"service_confirmation","point_type":"grammar_pattern","primary_node_slug":"requests_permission_advice","secondary_node_slugs":["honorifics_and_politeness","sentence_final_nuance"],"sub_category":"礼貌确认","core_meaning":"服务或商务场景中礼貌确认选项、内容或状态是否正确。","natural_translation":"……可以吗／……对吗","structure":"名词/な形容词词干 + でよろしいでしょうか","usage_notes":"用于确认对方选择；不应用来询问自己的许可，后者多用「〜てもよろしいでしょうか」。","practicality":"S","spoken_or_written":"both","jlpt_level":"N3","common_mistakes":["不要把所有「いいですか」都机械换成此形式，先确认是否是名词性选择。"],"base_type":"noun","required_form":"名词或な形容词词干","scenes":["customer_service","restaurant","phone_call"],"registers":["customer","business","formal"],"stage_slug":"natural_advanced_use","module_slug":"workplace_service","sort_order":310,"prerequisite_seed_keys":["gp_polite_style","gp_de_gozaimasu"],"examples":[{"jp":"お支払いはカードでよろしいでしょうか。","zh":"付款用银行卡可以吗？","scene":"shopping","register":"customer"},{"jp":"ご予約は二名様でよろしいでしょうか。","zh":"预约是两位，对吗？","scene":"restaurant","register":"customer"},{"jp":"折り返しのお電話は午後でよろしいでしょうか。","zh":"回电安排在下午可以吗？","scene":"phone_call","register":"business"}]},
  {"seed_key":"gp_ext_toiu_koto_de_yoroshii","grammar_point":"〜ということでよろしいでしょうか","canonical_form":"〜ということでよろしいでしょうか","sense_key":"service_proposition_confirmation","form_group_slug":"service_confirmation","point_type":"grammar_pattern","primary_node_slug":"requests_permission_advice","secondary_node_slugs":["quotation_reporting_topic","honorifics_and_politeness"],"sub_category":"命题内容确认","core_meaning":"把对方的话重新概括后，礼貌确认自己的理解是否正确。","natural_translation":"也就是说……，这样理解对吗","structure":"普通形 + ということでよろしいでしょうか","usage_notes":"适合确认复杂条件、决定或客户要求，比只说「ですね」更明确。","practicality":"S","spoken_or_written":"both","jlpt_level":"N3","common_mistakes":["重述内容必须准确，不能借确认擅自改变对方意思。"],"base_type":"clause","required_form":"普通形","scenes":["customer_service","phone_call","workplace"],"registers":["customer","business","formal"],"stage_slug":"natural_advanced_use","module_slug":"workplace_service","sort_order":320,"prerequisite_seed_keys":["gp_to_iu","gp_ext_de_yoroshii_deshouka"],"examples":[{"jp":"キャンセルではなく、日程変更ということでよろしいでしょうか。","zh":"不是取消，而是更改日期，这样理解对吗？","scene":"customer_service","register":"customer"},{"jp":"資料はメールで送付するということでよろしいでしょうか。","zh":"资料通过邮件发送，这样可以吗？","scene":"workplace","register":"business"},{"jp":"明日の予約を来週へ移すということでよろしいでしょうか。","zh":"把明天的预约改到下周，对吗？","scene":"phone_call","register":"formal"}]},
  {"seed_key":"gp_ext_wa_ikaga_deshouka","grammar_point":"〜はいかがでしょうか","canonical_form":"〜はいかがでしょうか","sense_key":"service_wa_ikaga_deshouka","form_group_slug":"polite_suggestions","point_type":"grammar_pattern","primary_node_slug":"requests_permission_advice","secondary_node_slugs":["honorifics_and_politeness"],"sub_category":"礼貌提议","core_meaning":"礼貌询问对方对某个商品、选项或方案的意见。","natural_translation":"……怎么样","structure":"名词/方案 + はいかがでしょうか","usage_notes":"比「どうですか」郑重，常用于店员推荐和商务提案。","practicality":"S","spoken_or_written":"both","jlpt_level":"N3","common_mistakes":["需要明确确认既定内容时应使用「でよろしいでしょうか」，不是提议形式。"],"base_type":"noun","required_form":"名词或方案","scenes":["restaurant","shopping","workplace"],"registers":["customer","business","formal"],"stage_slug":"natural_advanced_use","module_slug":"workplace_service","sort_order":330,"prerequisite_seed_keys":["gp_polite_style","gp_ta_hou_ga_ii"],"examples":[{"jp":"お飲み物はコーヒーはいかがでしょうか。","zh":"饮料来杯咖啡怎么样？","scene":"restaurant","register":"customer"},{"jp":"こちらの色はいかがでしょうか。","zh":"这个颜色怎么样？","scene":"shopping","register":"customer"},{"jp":"次回はオンライン会議ではいかがでしょうか。","zh":"下次改为线上会议怎么样？","scene":"workplace","register":"business"}]},
