  {"seed_key":"gp_ext_deshitara_taiou_kanou","grammar_point":"〜でしたら対応可能です","canonical_form":"〜でしたら対応可能です","sense_key":"service_conditional_alternative","form_group_slug":"service_alternatives","point_type":"collocation","primary_node_slug":"formulaic_scene_expressions","secondary_node_slugs":["conditions_and_hypotheses","ability_potential_difficulty"],"sub_category":"限定条件下可处理","core_meaning":"说明虽然原条件不可行，但在另一具体条件下可以处理。","natural_translation":"如果是……的话可以处理","structure":"名词/条件 + でしたら、対応可能です","usage_notes":"先明确可行边界，再让对方选择，避免模糊承诺。","practicality":"S","spoken_or_written":"both","jlpt_level":"N3","common_mistakes":["不能在尚未确认资源时轻率承诺「対応可能です」。"],"base_type":"noun","required_form":"可行条件","scenes":["customer_service","workplace","phone_call"],"registers":["customer","business","formal"],"stage_slug":"natural_advanced_use","module_slug":"workplace_service","sort_order":430,"prerequisite_seed_keys":["gp_nara","gp_dekiru"],"examples":[{"jp":"来週でしたら対応可能です。","zh":"如果是下周的话可以处理。","scene":"workplace","register":"business"},{"jp":"同じ商品への交換でしたら対応可能です。","zh":"如果换成同款商品的话可以处理。","scene":"customer_service","register":"customer"},{"jp":"午後三時以降でしたら、お電話でのご案内が可能です。","zh":"如果是下午三点以后，可以通过电话说明。","scene":"phone_call","register":"formal"}]},
