  {"seed_key":"gp_ext_wo_megutte","grammar_point":"〜をめぐって","canonical_form":"〜をめぐって","sense_key":"wo_megutte_issue_debate","form_group_slug":"topic_relations","point_type":"grammar_pattern","primary_node_slug":"quotation_reporting_topic","secondary_node_slugs":["compound_particles","contrast_concession_comparison"],"sub_category":"围绕争议话题","core_meaning":"表示多方围绕某个问题、事件或利益展开讨论、争议或行动。","natural_translation":"围绕……","structure":"争议或问题名词 + をめぐって","usage_notes":"常暗示存在多个立场；普通“关于”说明使用「について」。","practicality":"A","spoken_or_written":"written","jlpt_level":"N2","common_mistakes":["没有多方关系或争议时不要机械使用「をめぐって」。"],"base_type":"noun","required_form":"问题或争议名词","scenes":["workplace","government_office","school"],"registers":["news","written","academic"],"stage_slug":"natural_advanced_use","module_slug":"media_formal","sort_order":90,"prerequisite_seed_keys":["gp_ni_tsuite","gp_ni_taishite"],"examples":[{"jp":"新しい制度をめぐって議論が続いています。","zh":"围绕新制度的讨论仍在继续。","scene":"government_office","register":"news"},{"jp":"契約条件をめぐって両社が交渉しています。","zh":"两家公司正围绕合同条件进行谈判。","scene":"workplace","register":"written"},{"jp":"校則をめぐって生徒と学校が意見を交わしました。","zh":"学生与学校围绕校规交换了意见。","scene":"school","register":"news"}]},
  {"seed_key":"gp_ext_monono","grammar_point":"〜ものの","canonical_form":"〜ものの","sense_key":"monono_formal_concession","form_group_slug":"concession","point_type":"grammar_pattern","primary_node_slug":"contrast_concession_comparison","secondary_node_slugs":["adversative_connections","main_subordinate_clauses"],"sub_category":"书面让步","core_meaning":"正式承认前项事实，同时指出与预期不同或仍存在限制。","natural_translation":"虽然……但是……","structure":"普通形 + ものの；名词/な形容词 + であるものの","usage_notes":"比「けど」书面、客观，常用于报告和说明。","practicality":"S","spoken_or_written":"written","jlpt_level":"N2","common_mistakes":["后项应体现限制或反差，不能只是顺接结果。"],"base_type":"clause","required_form":"普通形","scenes":["workplace","school","government_office"],"registers":["written","formal","academic"],"stage_slug":"natural_advanced_use","module_slug":"media_formal","sort_order":100,"prerequisite_seed_keys":["gp_noni","gp_plain_style"],"examples":[{"jp":"改善は見られたものの、課題は残っています。","zh":"虽然有所改善，但问题仍然存在。","scene":"workplace","register":"written"},{"jp":"申請はしたものの、結果はまだ届いていません。","zh":"虽然申请了，但结果还没收到。","scene":"government_office","register":"formal"},{"jp":"内容は理解したものの、説明するのは難しいです。","zh":"虽然理解了内容，但很难说明。","scene":"school","register":"academic"}]},
  {"seed_key":"gp_ext_ni_mokakawarazu","grammar_point":"〜にもかかわらず","canonical_form":"〜にもかかわらず","sense_key":"nimokakawarazu_strong_concession","form_group_slug":"concession","point_type":"grammar_pattern","primary_node_slug":"contrast_concession_comparison","secondary_node_slugs":["adversative_connections","main_subordinate_clauses"],"sub_category":"强让步","core_meaning":"强调后项在前项条件下仍发生，明显违背通常预期。","natural_translation":"尽管……仍然……","structure":"普通形/名词 + にもかかわらず","usage_notes":"书面感较强，反差比「ものの」更鲜明。","practicality":"S","spoken_or_written":"written","jlpt_level":"N2","common_mistakes":["前后没有预期冲突时使用会显得逻辑夸张。"],"base_type":"clause","required_form":"普通形或名词","scenes":["workplace","transportation","school"],"registers":["written","formal","news"],"stage_slug":"natural_advanced_use","module_slug":"media_formal","sort_order":110,"prerequisite_seed_keys":["gp_noni","gp_ext_monono"],"examples":[{"jp":"大雨にもかかわらず、多くの人が参加しました。","zh":"尽管下着大雨，仍有很多人参加。","scene":"workplace","register":"news"},{"jp":"注意を受けたにもかかわらず、同じ問題が起きました。","zh":"尽管收到提醒，同样的问题仍然发生了。","scene":"school","register":"formal"},{"jp":"運休の発表にもかかわらず、駅には人が集まりました。","zh":"尽管宣布停运，车站仍聚集了人群。","scene":"transportation","register":"news"}]},
  {"seed_key":"gp_ext_koto_kara_inference","grammar_point":"〜ことから","canonical_form":"〜ことから","sense_key":"koto_kara_evidence_reason","form_group_slug":"koto_kara","point_type":"grammar_pattern","primary_node_slug":"reasons_and_explanations","secondary_node_slugs":["inference_judgment_sources","modification_connection_nominalization"],"sub_category":"事实依据与命名原因","core_meaning":"从某个事实、特征或观察结果推导判断、原因或名称。","natural_translation":"由于……／从……来看","structure":"普通形 + ことから；名词である + ことから","usage_notes":"比直接原因「から」更书面，前项常是可观察事实。","practicality":"S","spoken_or_written":"written","jlpt_level":"N2","common_mistakes":["主观情绪原因通常不用「ことから」包装成客观证据。"],"base_type":"clause","required_form":"普通形","scenes":["school","workplace","travel"],"registers":["written","academic","news"],"stage_slug":"natural_advanced_use","module_slug":"media_formal","sort_order":120,"prerequisite_seed_keys":["gp_koto_nominalization","gp_kara_reason"],"examples":[{"jp":"足跡が残っていたことから、動物が通ったとみられます。","zh":"由于留下了脚印，推测有动物经过。","scene":"school","register":"academic"},{"jp":"利用者が増えたことから、受付時間を延長しました。","zh":"由于使用者增加，延长了受理时间。","scene":"workplace","register":"written"},{"jp":"橋の形が眼鏡に似ていることから、この名が付けられました。","zh":"因桥的形状像眼镜而得名。","scene":"travel","register":"news"}]},
