  {"seed_key":"gp_ext_nao","grammar_point":"なお","canonical_form":"なお","sense_key":"nao_formal_addendum","form_group_slug":"formal_connectors","point_type":"discourse_marker","primary_node_slug":"additive_progression","secondary_node_slugs":["example_summary_topic_shift"],"sub_category":"正式补充说明","core_meaning":"在正式文本中补充与前文相关的重要信息。","natural_translation":"另外／此外需要说明的是","structure":"なお、句子","usage_notes":"补充内容通常不改变前文结论；口语可用「ちなみに」等。","practicality":"S","spoken_or_written":"written","jlpt_level":"N2","common_mistakes":["若后文是限制条件，应使用「ただし」，不是单纯补充的「なお」。"],"base_type":"clause","required_form":"句首连接","scenes":["email","workplace","government_office"],"registers":["written","formal","business"],"stage_slug":"natural_advanced_use","module_slug":"media_formal","sort_order":160,"prerequisite_seed_keys":["gp_soshite","gp_tatoeba"],"examples":[{"jp":"受付は五時までです。なお、土日は休業します。","zh":"受理到五点。另外，周末休息。","scene":"government_office","register":"formal"},{"jp":"資料を添付しました。なお、パスワードは別途送ります。","zh":"已附上资料。另外，密码另行发送。","scene":"email","register":"business"},{"jp":"参加費は無料です。なお、事前予約が必要です。","zh":"参加免费。另外，需要提前预约。","scene":"workplace","register":"written"}]},
