  {"seed_key":"gp_ext_mottomo","grammar_point":"もっとも","canonical_form":"もっとも","sense_key":"mottomo_qualification","form_group_slug":"formal_connectors","point_type":"discourse_marker","primary_node_slug":"adversative_connections","secondary_node_slugs":["sentence_final_nuance"],"sub_category":"补充保留条件","core_meaning":"承认前文大体成立，同时补充例外、保留或需要修正的一点。","natural_translation":"不过话又说回来／当然……除外","structure":"もっとも、句子","usage_notes":"比「ただし」更像说话人追加保留意见，而非正式规则限制。","practicality":"A","spoken_or_written":"written","jlpt_level":"N2","common_mistakes":["不要把表示程度的「もっと」和连接词「もっとも」混淆。"],"base_type":"clause","required_form":"句首连接","scenes":["workplace","school","daily_life"],"registers":["written","formal"],"stage_slug":"natural_advanced_use","module_slug":"media_formal","sort_order":180,"prerequisite_seed_keys":["gp_shikashi","gp_ext_tadashi"],"examples":[{"jp":"この方法が最も効率的です。もっとも、費用は高くなります。","zh":"这个方法效率最高，不过费用会增加。","scene":"workplace","register":"written"},{"jp":"参加は自由です。もっとも、席には限りがあります。","zh":"参加自由，不过座位有限。","scene":"school","register":"formal"},{"jp":"駅から歩けます。もっとも、雨の日は大変です。","zh":"可以从车站步行，不过下雨天会很辛苦。","scene":"daily_life","register":"written"}]},
  {"seed_key":"gp_ext_towaie","grammar_point":"〜とはいえ","canonical_form":"〜とはいえ","sense_key":"towaie_concession_reassessment","form_group_slug":"concession","point_type":"grammar_pattern","primary_node_slug":"contrast_concession_comparison","secondary_node_slugs":["adversative_connections"],"sub_category":"承认后重新评估","core_meaning":"承认前项称谓或事实，但指出不能因此完全得出预想结论。","natural_translation":"虽说……但……","structure":"普通形/名词 + とはいえ","usage_notes":"适合对前项评价作限制，比「ても」更书面、有论述感。","practicality":"A","spoken_or_written":"written","jlpt_level":"N2","common_mistakes":["后项必须对前项可能引出的结论进行修正。"],"base_type":"clause","required_form":"普通形或名词","scenes":["workplace","school","daily_life"],"registers":["written","formal"],"stage_slug":"natural_advanced_use","module_slug":"media_formal","sort_order":190,"prerequisite_seed_keys":["gp_temo","gp_ext_monono"],"examples":[{"jp":"春とはいえ、朝晩はまだ寒いです。","zh":"虽说是春天，早晚仍然很冷。","scene":"daily_life","register":"written"},{"jp":"経験者とはいえ、準備は必要です。","zh":"虽说有经验，准备仍然必要。","scene":"workplace","register":"formal"},{"jp":"簡単とはいえ、確認を省いてはいけません。","zh":"虽说简单，也不能省略确认。","scene":"school","register":"written"}]},
  {"seed_key":"gp_ext_shitagatte","grammar_point":"したがって","canonical_form":"したがって","sense_key":"shitagatte_logical_result","form_group_slug":"formal_connectors","point_type":"discourse_marker","primary_node_slug":"cause_result_connections","secondary_node_slugs":["additive_progression"],"sub_category":"逻辑结论","core_meaning":"根据前文事实或论证正式推出后文结论。","natural_translation":"因此／所以","structure":"前文。したがって、结论","usage_notes":"论述和正式说明中使用；个人随口理由通常用「だから／そのため」。","practicality":"S","spoken_or_written":"written","jlpt_level":"N2","common_mistakes":["前文不足以逻辑推出后文时不能使用「したがって」。"],"base_type":"clause","required_form":"句首连接","scenes":["workplace","school","government_office"],"registers":["written","academic","formal"],"stage_slug":"natural_advanced_use","module_slug":"media_formal","sort_order":200,"prerequisite_seed_keys":["gp_sono_tame","gp_tsumari"],"examples":[{"jp":"申請期限を過ぎています。したがって、今回は受理できません。","zh":"已经超过申请期限。因此本次无法受理。","scene":"government_office","register":"formal"},{"jp":"需要が増加しています。したがって、生産量を増やす必要があります。","zh":"需求正在增加。因此需要增加产量。","scene":"workplace","register":"written"},{"jp":"この仮説はデータと一致しません。したがって、修正が必要です。","zh":"该假设与数据不符。因此需要修正。","scene":"school","register":"academic"}]},
  {"seed_key":"gp_ext_ni_kansuru","grammar_point":"〜に関する","canonical_form":"〜に関する","sense_key":"ni_kansuru_attributive_topic","form_group_slug":"ni_kansuru","point_type":"grammar_pattern","primary_node_slug":"noun_modifying_clauses","secondary_node_slugs":["compound_particles","quotation_reporting_topic"],"sub_category":"正式相关修饰","core_meaning":"正式表示后面的名词与某主题相关。","natural_translation":"有关……的","structure":"名词 + に関する + 名词","usage_notes":"是「に関して」的连体形式；不能直接用「に関して名词」。","practicality":"S","spoken_or_written":"written","jlpt_level":"N2","common_mistakes":["修饰名词时需要「に関する」，不能漏掉「する」。"],"base_type":"noun","required_form":"主题名词","scenes":["workplace","school","government_office"],"registers":["written","formal","academic"],"stage_slug":"natural_advanced_use","module_slug":"media_formal","sort_order":210,"prerequisite_seed_keys":["gp_rentai_modifier","gp_ni_tsuite"],"examples":[{"jp":"個人情報に関する規定を確認してください。","zh":"请确认有关个人信息的规定。","scene":"workplace","register":"formal"},{"jp":"環境問題に関する研究を行っています。","zh":"正在进行有关环境问题的研究。","scene":"school","register":"academic"},{"jp":"申請に関するお問い合わせはこちらです。","zh":"有关申请的咨询请联系这里。","scene":"government_office","register":"written"}]},
