  {"seed_key":"gp_ext_wo_hajime","grammar_point":"〜をはじめ","canonical_form":"〜をはじめ","sense_key":"wo_hajime_representative_example","form_group_slug":"representative_examples","point_type":"grammar_pattern","primary_node_slug":"comparison_degree_scope","secondary_node_slugs":["adverbial_particles","additive_progression"],"sub_category":"以代表项为首","core_meaning":"先举出最具代表性的一项，再说明包含其他同类对象。","natural_translation":"以……为首／包括……在内","structure":"代表名词 + をはじめ（として）","usage_notes":"前项应是后续范围中的代表成员，不是时间上的“开始”。","practicality":"A","spoken_or_written":"written","jlpt_level":"N2","common_mistakes":["不要与动词「始める」混淆。"],"base_type":"noun","required_form":"代表成员名词","scenes":["workplace","school","travel"],"registers":["written","formal","news"],"stage_slug":"natural_advanced_use","module_slug":"advanced_natural","sort_order":380,"prerequisite_seed_keys":["gp_tatoeba","gp_nado_particle"],"examples":[{"jp":"社長をはじめ、多くの社員が参加しました。","zh":"以社长为首，很多员工参加了。","scene":"workplace","register":"news"},{"jp":"京都には清水寺をはじめ、有名な寺がたくさんあります。","zh":"京都有以清水寺为代表的许多著名寺院。","scene":"travel","register":"written"},{"jp":"日本をはじめ、各国から学生が集まりました。","zh":"包括日本在内，各国学生聚集而来。","scene":"school","register":"formal"}]},
  {"seed_key":"gp_ext_dake_de_naku","grammar_point":"〜だけでなく","canonical_form":"〜だけでなく","sense_key":"dake_de_naku_not_only","form_group_slug":"additive_emphasis","point_type":"grammar_pattern","primary_node_slug":"comparison_degree_scope","secondary_node_slugs":["additive_progression"],"sub_category":"不仅还","core_meaning":"否定范围只限于前项，并追加后项。","natural_translation":"不仅……而且……","structure":"名词/普通形 + だけでなく（〜も）","usage_notes":"后项常用「も」呼应，但不是绝对必须。","practicality":"S","spoken_or_written":"both","jlpt_level":"N3","common_mistakes":["前后应属于可并列的同类范围。"],"base_type":"clause","required_form":"名词或普通形","scenes":["daily_life","workplace","school"],"registers":["casual","polite","written"],"stage_slug":"natural_advanced_use","module_slug":"advanced_natural","sort_order":390,"prerequisite_seed_keys":["gp_dake","gp_mo_particle"],"examples":[{"jp":"この店は安いだけでなく、サービスもいいです。","zh":"这家店不仅便宜，服务也好。","scene":"shopping","register":"polite"},{"jp":"彼は日本語だけでなく、中国語も話せます。","zh":"他不仅会日语，也会中文。","scene":"school","register":"polite"},{"jp":"資料を読むだけでなく、実際に試してください。","zh":"不要只读资料，也请实际尝试。","scene":"workplace","register":"formal"}]},
  {"seed_key":"gp_ext_bakari_ka","grammar_point":"〜ばかりか","canonical_form":"〜ばかりか","sense_key":"bakari_ka_additive_escalation","form_group_slug":"additive_emphasis","point_type":"grammar_pattern","primary_node_slug":"comparison_degree_scope","secondary_node_slugs":["additive_progression"],"sub_category":"递进追加","core_meaning":"表示不但前项成立，程度更高或更意外的后项也成立。","natural_translation":"不但……而且甚至……","structure":"名词/普通形 + ばかりか","usage_notes":"比「だけでなく」更书面，后项通常在程度或意外性上递进。","practicality":"A","spoken_or_written":"written","jlpt_level":"N2","common_mistakes":["后项若不比前项更进一步，递进感会不足。"],"base_type":"clause","required_form":"名词或普通形","scenes":["workplace","school","daily_life"],"registers":["written","formal"],"stage_slug":"natural_advanced_use","module_slug":"advanced_natural","sort_order":400,"prerequisite_seed_keys":["gp_ext_dake_de_naku","gp_bakari"],"examples":[{"jp":"彼は謝らないばかりか、責任を他人に押しつけました。","zh":"他不但不道歉，甚至把责任推给别人。","scene":"workplace","register":"written"},{"jp":"この薬は効果がないばかりか、副作用もあります。","zh":"这种药不但没有效果，还有副作用。","scene":"hospital","register":"formal"},{"jp":"雨ばかりか、強い風まで吹いてきた。","zh":"不但下雨，甚至还刮起了强风。","scene":"daily_life","register":"written"}]},
